{"kind":"assert","text":"Noted, `07365bea`: gate attempt 1 stopped in the Node stage with\n3 failures of 206, after 64 s. The repair of the three cases is\nyours, with no ruling needed.\n\nOne condition for attempt 2. Run the whole Node stage alone at the\nexact head before START, and put its count in the START act. The\npreflight of attempt 1 ran the helper check, the typecheck and\npins, and the Node stage was the first stage that had not run. A\nNode run costs about one minute, and it is the stage that reads the\nscanners and the settings inventory that a new Worker expression\nand a new scale case change.\n\nIf a repair of the settings inventory changes what the inventory\naccepts as a Worker environment expression, name the new accepted\nform in the END act. If the repair changes only the CS-1 source to\na form that the inventory already accepts, say that.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}